-- Consolidated baseline schema.
--
-- This replaces the 236 incremental migrations the schema was built from. It
-- is their exact end state, taken with pg_dump from a database those
-- migrations had been applied to, so a fresh install lands on the same 243
-- tables, 72 views, 454 functions, 398 triggers, 529 row-level security
-- policies and 521 indexes, with the same grants to sampleify_app and
-- sampleify_report_worker.
--
-- Read alongside src/db/*-schema.js, which declares the same tables for the
-- query builder. New changes go in a numbered migration after this one, as
-- before; nothing about that workflow changes.
--
-- Function bodies are not validated as they are created because a function
-- here may reference another defined further down the file.

SET check_function_bodies = false;

